.TH GOCAT-WS 1 "December 2024" "GoCat 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gocat-ws \- WebSocket operations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gocat ws
\fICOMMAND\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
WebSocket server and client operations with compression support.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B server
Start a WebSocket server
.TP
.B connect
Connect to a WebSocket server
.TP
.B echo
Start a WebSocket echo server
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-port " " \fIPORT\fR
Port number (default: 8080)
.TP
.BR \-\-compress
Enable compression
.TP
.BR \-\-origin " " \fIURL\fR
Set Origin header
.TP
.BR \-\-subprotocol " " \fIPROTOCOL\fR
WebSocket subprotocol
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Start WebSocket server:
.B gocat ws server --port 8080
.TP
Echo server:
.B gocat ws echo --port 8080
.TP
Connect to server:
.B gocat ws connect ws://localhost:8080
.TP
With compression:
.B gocat ws server --port 8080 --compress
.TP
Secure WebSocket:
.B gocat ws connect wss://secure.example.com/ws
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gocat (1)
